# Defaults for `pwmigrate` (playhouse.migrations). Lets every command run
# bare, e.g. `pwmigrate status`, `pwmigrate up`, `pwmigrate diff`:
# the database is the app's db (dev: falcon.db, tests: temp file via
# DATABASE_URL), the models are diffed from app.models.
database = app.models.db
models = app.models
# directory = migrations
# table = schema_migration
